From 1d93bd524190d29e79e78267230ed0c4c2715369 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 09:29:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 244/245] reaper: record shipped v1.8.4-v1.8.6 (audit
 remediation + review hardening)

Previously shipped to the ladder as uncommitted working-tree changes;
recording now before branching to rt-be88u so the shipped source is in history.

v1.8.4 (Batch F) - 12 LATENT audit fixes: web.c cosql result init, vis_gui
valopt, firewall sscanf field-widths + WAN snmp dport 161, rmcpd bounded reap
/expiry-reject/unlink/scrubber, Reaper_Traffic Array.isArray guards,
Reaper_Warden geo-preserve, services.c value-as-format printf %s, rtrafd
local-wallclock bucket alignment.

v1.8.5 (Batch G) - 18 confirmed-low fixes: snmpd empty-v3-passphrase guard,
wanduck modem_type init, shutils ping-target charset gate + arpcache fclose,
rmcpd fence_rule status/refuse-to-arm, rchqd first-event logging flags,
reaper_inject ferror propagation, CP/chilli goto-cleanup MTLAN-leak fix +
realip fopen NULL-check, udhcpc %u, rtrafd dead-parsed/%x, www
curStep/lastToken removal + shared renderQuota.

v1.8.6 - review hardening (two-agent review + self-verify): CP/chilli
cleanup-label ifdef portability, web.c result=NULL cross-iteration guard,
gatekeeper lan_ifname charset gate (S7 twin), Reaper_GK gkMac validation,
reaper_mcp JSON port/timeout numeric emit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
